ent-426968874"},"message":"I'm clearly for a plain `git init` call. Particularly, since this actually is the last part, where GitPython's `Repo` is not lazily instantiated. (Apart from that I want to remove it entirely anyway)\nGiving it a quick try didn't instantly work, since that direct call failed to create the directory if it wasn't there. That's confusing because via command line `git init` does create it. Need to figure why this fails when called via `GitRunner`.","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1540836284,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQzNDAxNzI5Ng==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2818#issuecomment-434017296"},"message":"FTR: This PR now does create without a GitPy init (which speeds things up) and also let's one pass arbitrary option through to `git init`: https://github.com/datalad/datalad-revolution/pull/38","files":null},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1543051192,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDE5ODQ5MjcxNTA="},"added":["fixed-in-revolution"],"removed":[]},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1557206216,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ4OTkxMTgyMQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2818#issuecomment-489911821"},"message":"With #3383 merged, this is now fixed in master.","files":null},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1557206216,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MjMyMjk3NDE0MA=="},"status":2}]}